description=Run Linux containers on Android via a privileged daemon that bypasses the app seccomp filter. Docker Hub pull, private-namespace mounts with host hardening (RO /sys, masked /dev/block+/dev/socket, capability drops, subset=pid proc), --shared-storage, container-owned DNS (Google+Cloudflare), PTY shells, mini-systemd init + systemctl shim, --shared-display (termux-x11) + --shared-audio, ports (LAN reachability), setuser least privilege, convert --move, optional box64.
